===Etymology===
[[haplology|Haplology]] from {{der|en|la|sanatus}}, past participle of {{m|la|sānō||to cure, to heal}}, + {{der|en|la|-torium}}. Alternatively, alteration of {{m|en|sanitarium}} influenced by words like {{m|en|curatorium}} and {{m|en|moratorium}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˌsænəˈtɔɹiəm/}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
